    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Hospital, Nairobi (AKUH,N) and the Aga Khan Health Services, East Africa have received a grant of 8million Euros (Ksh. 950M) from the German Government to boost the COVID-19 vaccination campaign in East Africa and support the public health system.",
